						<td valign="top" width="85%" height="100%">
							<table width="100%" border="0"><tr>
								<td align="left" valign="middle"><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=955.msg9510#msg9510"><img src="http://www.rodcetnife.org/Themes/classic/images/post/xx.gif" alt="" border="0" /></a></td>
								<td align="left" valign="middle">
									<b><a href="http://www.rodcetnife.org/index.php?topic=955.msg9510#msg9510">Warning for Those who play Rodcet Nife. (Another thread about new Grum)</a></b><br />
									<span class="smalltext">&#171; <b>Reply #10 on:</b> July 25, 2004, 12:21:52 pm &#187;</span></td>
								<td align="right" valign="bottom" height="20" nowrap="nowrap" style="font-size: smaller;">
								</td>
							</tr></table>
							<hr width="100%" size="1" class="hrcolor" />
							This post is for anyone who trades or deals on Rodcet Nife I was scammed tonight by a guy named Grum 65 troll war and Gruker a bard. I gave him Wind-Worn Handblade and 6k for MQ of Shattered Emerald of Corruption and was to give him 5k more on completion of MQ. Instead he did not finish MQ took the cash and item. Be Warned this guy is bad news. Just Beware thats all. I have screens of the whole event.<br />Once again names are <b>Grum</b> and <b>Gruker</b>. I recommend you avoid this guy at all costs. Good luck to everyone out there, and I hope this never happens to one of of you it really stinks.<br />Screens here. &gt; <a href="http://www.geocities.com/mystic_jester_tj" target="_blank">www.geocities.com/mystic_jester_tj</a>
						</td>
					</tr>
					<tr>
